// Stormglass Commons Character Appearance H2.
//
// Six public family mantles are promoted from compiler/native-GPU proof tiles
// to tailored local material kits over the immutable H1 shared body. Family
// identity is carried only by detachable silhouette, weave, glyph, fastening,
// edge treatment, and captions in the village_story_unblinded profile. These
// kits cannot join live blinded research or mutate any resident observation.

